  "APIProfile":           "Basic",
  "Description":          "Response and Scene Rendering: renders the machine's response - a Text - as a Speaking Avatar of the input Avatar Model, ready to play; whoever requested it places it in a scene and renders it (e.g. with Scene and Avatar Rendering). Personal Status De-multiplexing splits a Personal Status into the Speech, Face and Body Personal Statuses that make the avatar expressive; Text-To-Speech makes the Machine Speech, with a Speech Model when one is supplied; Speaking Avatar Formation forms the Speaking Avatar from it - or from an Input Speech, when one is supplied.",

  "InternalTypes":        [{"Name": "SpeechPersonalStatus", "DataType": "MMC-SPS-V2.5"},
                          {"Name": "FacePersonalStatus", "DataType": "MMC-FPS-V2.5"},
                          {"Name": "BodyPersonalStatus", "DataType": "MMC-BPS-V2.5"},
                          {"Name": "MachineSpeech", "DataType": "OSD-BSO-V1.5", "Output": 2}],

